SUMMARY:🇺🇸 3rd of July at ZincHouse | Live Music\, Drinks & Firework
 s
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\n🇺🇸 Kick off the holiday weeken
 d with an evening at one of the Triangle’s best outdoor venues. We’ll 
 meet for drinks\, enjoy the live music\, grab food from the trucks\, and s
 tay for the fireworks show at 9 PM.\n\nWhether you’re coming with friend
 s or flying solo\, I’ll make sure everyone has people to hang out with.\
 n\nThe Plan\n🍷 Meet at 6:30 PM (I’ll post the exact meetup location t
 he day of)\n🎵 Live music throughout the evening\n🌮 Food trucks\n🍹
  Cocktails\, wine & beer\n🎆 Fireworks show at 9:00 PM\n\nA few notes:\n
 \n* Free admission\n* This is a 21+ venue.\n* Lawn chairs are welcome if y
 ou’d like to watch the fireworks from the lawn.\n\nWear your red\, white
 \, and blue if you’re feeling festive\, and come kick off Independence D
 ay weekend with good people\, great drinks\, and one of the best fireworks
  shows around. 🇺🇸🍻
